---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/global/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/global/Footer.astro';
import Container from '../../components/global/Container.astro';
import Section from '../../components/global/Section.astro';
import TechnicalLabel from '../../components/global/TechnicalLabel.astro';
import Button from '../../components/global/Button.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="ScioTeq | AionSi Semiconductor & Embedded Engineering" description="AionSi technical engineering proposition for ScioTeq: FPGA, DO-254 verification, high-speed interfaces and scalable India ODC engineering capacity.">
  <Header />
  <main>
    <Section class="bg-[var(--aionsi-surface-alt)] py-14 md:py-20">
      <Container>
        <TechnicalLabel>SCIO TEQ · TECHNICAL ENGINEERING BRIEF</TechnicalLabel>
        <div class="mt-5 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.25fr_.75fr] lg:items-center">
          <div>
            <h1 class="max-w-5xl text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--aionsi-navy)] md:text-7xl">Engineering leverage for ScioTeq’s next-generation platforms.</h1>
            <p class="mt-6 max-w-4xl text-xl leading-9 text-slate-600 md:text-2xl">AionSi can complement ScioTeq’s existing engineering ecosystem with semiconductor, FPGA, verification and embedded engineering capacity — starting with a focused work package and scaling into a dedicated India ODC.</p>
            <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><Button href="#entry">Explore the opportunity →</Button><a href="#strategy" class="inline-flex items-center border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">View engagement strategy</a></div>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 border-t-2 border-t-[var(--aionsi-blue)] bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
            <TechnicalLabel>EXECUTIVE SIGNAL</TechnicalLabel>
            <div class="mt-3 text-5xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-blue)]">01</div>
            <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Specialist second-source</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Do not lead with a vendor-replacement pitch. Enter where AionSi is differentiated: PCIe/high-speed IP, SystemVerilog/UVM, FPGA engineering and scalable ODC execution.</p>
            <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 border-t border-slate-200 pt-5 text-center"><div><strong class="block text-xl text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">140+</strong><span class="text-xs text-slate-500">R&amp;D*</span></div><div><strong class="block text-xl text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">32</strong><span class="text-xs text-slate-500">roles*</span></div><div><strong class="block text-xl text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">3</strong><span class="text-xs text-slate-500">entry tracks</span></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </Section>
    <section class="border-y border-slate-200 bg-white"><Container class="grid gap-0 md:grid-cols-3">{[['Recommended motion','Technical discovery → defined pilot → engineering pod → India ODC'],['Primary wedge','FPGA / DO-254 verification + high-speed interface engineering'],['Strategic timing','Bangalore presence + product expansion + active engineering demand']].map(([title,desc]) => <div class="border-x border-slate-200 px-5 py-5 first:border-l-0 last:border-r-0"><TechnicalLabel>{title}</TechnicalLabel><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">{desc}</p></div>)}</Container></section>
    <Section id="entry"><Container><TechnicalLabel>WHERE TO ENTER</TechnicalLabel><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--aionsi-navy)] md:text-5xl">Three conversations. One expansion path.</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-lg text-slate-600">Lead with a technical problem, not a generic staffing proposition.</p><div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">{[['01','NOW · HIGH FIT','FPGA & DO-254 Engineering','Offer verification, RTL support, regression automation and certification-oriented engineering around FPGA-heavy avionics and defense programs.',['VHDL / FPGA verification','SystemVerilog / UVM','DO-254 evidence & coverage']],['02','TECHNICAL WEDGE','High-Speed / PCIe IP','Position AionSi around modern interconnect and FPGA↔compute integration, especially where future compute platforms require high-speed interfaces.',['PCIe IP / DLL expertise','FPGA integration','Protocol verification']],['03','EXPANSION','India Engineering ODC','Use the Bangalore footprint as the bridge from a small technical engagement to a dedicated engineering pod supporting product programs.',['3–5 engineer pilot pod','Scale to 6–10+','Multi-program ownership']]].map(([num,tag,title,desc,items]) => <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-[var(--aionsi-blue)]"><span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[.16em] text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">{num}</span><TechnicalLabel>{tag}</TechnicalLabel><h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">{title}</h3><p class="mt-3 min-h-[92px] text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">{desc}</p><div class="mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">{items.map(item => <div class="py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600">→ {item}</div>)}</div></article>)}</div></Container></Section>
    <section id="strategy" class="border-y border-slate-800 bg-[var(--aionsi-deep-navy)] py-14 text-white md:py-20"><Container><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center"><div><TechnicalLabel>THE SALES STRATEGY</TechnicalLabel><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold md:text-5xl">Complement the incumbent.<br/>Own a deliverable.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/70">The objective is not to win a vendor replacement conversation. Make AionSi useful on one technically bounded work package that ScioTeq can measure.</p></div><div class="border-l border-white/10 pl-5">{[['01','Discover','Identify capacity, schedule or verification bottlenecks.'],['02','Qualify','Confirm pain, technical owner, deadline and budget.'],['03','Pilot','1–3 engineers, one work package, 8–12 weeks.'],['04','Expand','Convert the pilot into a 3–5 person engineering pod.'],['05','Establish ODC','Build a repeatable India delivery capability.']].map(([num,title,desc]) => <div class="grid grid-cols-[40px_1fr] gap-4 border-b border-white/10 py-4"><span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[.16em] text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">{num}</span><div><strong>{title}</strong><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/60">{desc}</p></div></div>)}</div></div></Container></section>
    <Section><Container><TechnicalLabel>BUYING CENTER</TechnicalLabel><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)] md:text-5xl">Start with engineering. Build executive sponsorship.</h2><div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">{[['TECHNICAL CHAMPION','Lieven Demeestere','R&D Director'],['TECHNICAL OWNER','Brecht Baert','R&D Manager · Avionics Software'],['BUSINESS / TECH','Neal Toso','Director · Technical Business Development'],['BUSINESS SPONSOR','Mike Ingram','Chief Commercial Officer']].map(([role,name,title]) => <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm"><TechnicalLabel>{role}</TechnicalLabel><h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">{name}</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">{title}</p></article>)}</div></Container></Section>
    <Section class="bg-[var(--aionsi-surface-alt)]"><Container><div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[.7fr_1.3fr]"><div><TechnicalLabel>AIONSI POSITIONING</TechnicalLabel><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)] md:text-4xl">Why AionSi can be different.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">ScioTeq’s ecosystem already includes specialist engineering partners. Introduce AionSi where semiconductor depth creates incremental value rather than overlap.</p></div><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">{[['Silicon engineering','RTL · FPGA · IP · SystemVerilog · UVM'],['High-speed interfaces','PCIe · protocol verification · FPGA integration'],['Safety-oriented execution','Verification discipline · traceability · quality gates'],['ODC scalability','Dedicated pod · technical ownership · India delivery']].map(([title,desc]) => <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">{title}</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">{desc}</p></div>)}</div></div></Container></Section>
    <Section><Container><TechnicalLabel>NEXT BEST ACTION</TechnicalLabel><div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-6 border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between"><div><h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Get ScioTeq into a technical workshop.</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Ask: “Which FPGA, verification or embedded work package is currently constrained by capacity or schedule?”</p></div><Button href="/contact">Start the engineering conversation</Button></div></Container></Section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
